# WasteNet-FOMO — Training Log

> **Goal:** Deploy a 4-class waste detector as an INT8 TFLite model on OpenMV RT1062.
> **Requirements:** `< 200 KB` · `≥ 0.80 recall` on `≥ 3 of 4` classes on the balanced test set.

---

## Model

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
| Input | 96×96×3 RGB |
| Architecture | FOMO (Faster Objects, More Objects) |
| Backbone | 5× Depthwise Separable Conv blocks |
| Head | GlobalAveragePool → Conv2D(5,1) → UpSample → Softmax |
| Output | 12×12×5 heatmap |
| Trainable params | ~36,500 |
| INT8 size | **63.6 KB** ✅ (budget: 200 KB) |

---

## Classes

| ID | Class | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | Background | — |
| 1 | General | Mixed trash bags, non-recyclable packaging |
| 2 | Recyclable | Plastic bottles, labelled cans, paper |
| 3 | Biodegradable | Food scraps, vegetable peels, organic matter |
| 4 | Metal | Bare aluminium/tin cans (no label) |

