### Runs 15–17 — Architecture Widening + GAP Head

```
Change:   Backbone widened: stem 8→16, max_filters 64→128
          Head: spatial Conv2D  →  GlobalAveragePool head
          LR:   CosineDecay experiments
Size:     28.8 KB  →  63.6 KB  (still within 200 KB budget)
```

**Result:** Wider backbone improved per-class discrimination. GAP head forces all 144 output cells to share a single 128-dim prediction vector — consistent with whole-image labelling but discards spatial cues. Metal reached 0.75–0.78; general stuck at 0.60–0.65.

| Class | Recall |
|---|---|
| General | ~0.62 ❌ |
| Recyclable | ~0.62 ❌ |
| Biodegradable | ~0.80 ✅ |
| Metal | ~0.75 ❌ |

