### Run 18 — Best Run ⭐

```
Loss:         Focal Loss (γ=2)
Weights:      CLASS_WEIGHTS = [1, 1, 1, 1, 1]  (equal)
LR:           CosineDecay  5e-4 → 5e-6  over 80 epochs
Checkpoint:   MinClassAccCheckpoint  (saves best min per-class val accuracy)
EarlyStopping patience=25
Stopped at:   epoch 72  (best val_fg epoch = 47, val_fg = 0.6083)
Size:         63.6 KB ✅
```

**Key addition — `MinClassAccCheckpoint`:** Standard `ModelCheckpoint` monitors mean `val_fg_accuracy` — it saves an epoch where one class dominates (e.g. biodeg=0.95, others=0.40 looks great on mean). This custom callback instead saves `best_min.keras` whenever `min(per-class val accuracy)` improves, selecting the most balanced epoch.

